From eccb9cfd9f7a58bb84254b244430ef993eade7ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin Michaud <jmichaud@igalia.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 10:52:48 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 02/17] [mya] Build mya on linux
 https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=325094

Reviewed by NOBODY (OOPS!).

This patch is the first step to getting mya working on linux. We add a stub implementation
that does almost nothing, but it confirms that mya can bulid and run on linux.

mya on macOS with cmake and with xcodebuild still work as expected.

We also re-work the testing code a bit to make it easier to add new tests out-of-process.

